 "account_notes": {
  "Bell Canada": "Bell people list their employer as plain \"Bell\" on LinkedIn, and Bell's management ladder runs Senior Manager, Associate Director, Director, VP; Associate Director is a real management tier here and stays on the map. Billing, credit and collections and shared services sit under Finance Operations (Matt MacEwen); customer, client and provisioning operations sit under Customer Operations (James Beresford). Clay's index holds few Bell Director-and-above operations titles, so the map is deliberately built from Associate Director up; the next layer to search directly in Sales Navigator is Senior Manager, Workforce Management (three surfaced: customer care WFM, IVR call routing WFM, business intelligence and WFM). Salesforce already holds 280 Bell contacts; the two Workforce Management directors on record (Gendron, Frappier) have since changed roles, and Sebastien Lafond (VP Customer Operations, Shared Services) no longer surfaces as current.",
  "BMO": "The Canadian bank and BMO U.S. are separate entities in every data source; this map spans both because operations are run North America wide (Deposit Operations US and Canada, Corporate and Commercial Lending Operations in Toronto and Chicago). Mona Malone became Chief Administrative Officer of BMO Financial Group in July 2025; Ann Marie Wright became US Chief Administrative Officer in November 2025. Jean-Michel Ares (Chief Technology & Operations Officer on the Salesforce record) has left BMO. Doug Sibley (Managing Director, Global Head of KYC, Client Onboarding and Client Operations, BMO Capital Markets) is confirmed in seat but has no findable LinkedIn profile; search him in Sales Navigator. Annie Ling (Chief Operating Officer) and Eli Laxmeter (VP Operations Technology) surfaced in search but could not be confirmed live.",
  "Telus": "TELUS is two back offices: the telecom (billing and revenue assurance under Finance, customer service delivery and service assurance under the Chief Operations Officer) and TELUS Health (employer operations, retirement and benefit solutions administration, absence and disability management), which is a large processing business in its own right. Hesham Fahmy became EVP, Chief Operations Officer and CIO in February 2026. Salesforce holds only 31 TELUS contacts; Luca Zoppi and Daniel Yeung on the record have moved on. Clay's index holds few Director-and-above telecom operations titles at TELUS; search Sales Navigator directly for Director, Credit & Collections, Director, Billing Operations and Director, Order Management. TELUS International (a separate Salesforce account and a BPO) is out of scope for this map.",
  "Canada Life": "Canada Life's back office is disability and claims operations (London, Winnipeg, Toronto, Calgary), group and plan-sponsor shared services, policy services and the retirement and investment operations under Workplace Retirement and Savings. Brady Aarssen became SVP, Canada Operations in October 2025 and is the operations executive on this map. The UK and Ireland arms (Canada Life UK, Canada Life Asset Management, Irish Life) share the LinkedIn company page and were removed. Brad Fedorchuk (EVP Group Customer, on the Salesforce record) left in June 2025; Michael Jones (VP Group Life and Disability Claims) retired in April 2026; Stefan Kristjanson (SVP Group Operations) is now chair at Irish Life. Salesforce holds 81 Canada Life contacts."
 },
